{
  "id": "1TI.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1TI",
  "reference": "1 Dimoteo 1",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini Bawlo geawooschi giijasoocheanda Yesu Gristo aba diigheanda ASEETA was lealnoocheandeanya ea Yesu Gristoyda was ghusoodeanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea Dimoteo orjeedeanyu bea huumwa aba naweeda masaweega. Nyasa dagheerjeanduumeeda ea baydeayda ea hoyyooyda leabu heeda ASEETA was Bwaabwa ea Yesu Gristo was Ng'utamiideanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Reekusiinda aba badayda giinealshooda ng'uyeega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda ghayi eaweewi Makedoniya geamuscheey gideaba abiidana Efeso. Ak eara ghamneawa geamuscheey aba gideaba gwanda fiisu anaal giinealshooda ng'uyeega aghuuma fiisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea adagang'ula ng'asheega ghwasiildeanga ea iitooda gheambaghweaniga mamuudeana jea gweadu sheang'nyeeda ak ea mwaloada gil nea mii gheambalmeeda ASEETA mida jeeda masaweega, asi sindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidasibaysiina diigheanji ea bariinyeega leabu jeedeesh ea ng'asheega rinna ghuuta miy gil ea masaweega manda giimiituunoodeaba geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buuneesuurja iimwanyasa naweeda miy ak gwayamsa geat ng'asheega mwadaagha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa gagasa gideaba gayghoah giinealshoodiga deaweedeeda, ak ea mwanala ng'asheegiga baloolean, nea eara ng'asheega baloola nea goomajeeksa ghanyea mwanala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geanali gideaba deaweeda aamiy, siida ii gadiyeata aba naweeda hit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gagasa eanala ng'asheanji gideaba deaweeda mamiisiina siida doabiiwaat, gammiisa fuga munyas, ea gea mwaada geeshta deaweeda, ea fuga mamwasa ASEETA, ea fuga riing'eega, ea gea sina ng'asheega munyas, ea fuga mabata ASEETA, ea fuga bara ghweaniga nyaawa, ea inyeessa bara gheamadiga nyaawa, ea fuga nuusa buuneeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga mealuuli, ea ng'eedeeda mealuuli sea niirja, ghana fuga jagwadi suurja, ea gea ng'uyeega, ea fuga ak habeawooda ng'uyeega, ea iimida ng'asheanda wassean maweapchi sea giinealshoodida bea huumwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giinealshooni ea diita ghayi sigoonan darukwiida Giijasta Miy bea badayda giigheambiita ASEETA diita mideawa ghawoodean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badiischeesiinda ASEETA aba baydeaydaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini geabadiischeesi Yesu Gristoyda was Ng'utamiideanya goonan uurda aba gideaba ghwadaah geawooschi doabiiwaat, ak ghwayiinan jeeda gadiyeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda aniini ghayi ea mwali inyeessa geanyareesay buuneeda nea geang'eaway, nea geasawanyi ak ghaanyaschi baydeayda aba gideaba geasinyi ng'asheesu aba leendeeda, aba gideaba meandeawani masaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaanyaschi muuchi dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiideanya, ea masaweega ea bariinyeega mida jeeda Gristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji huumwa gil, ak gammiisa masooda muuchi gideaba Gristo Yesu ghwahidu muunda ng'eanyiida gwalealu fuga riing'eega, ak siida madeeda aba jeedeaba fiisu ea aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba seareeni ea naanyaschi baydeayda aba gideaba aniineani bea madeedean, ghoadaajiit Yesu Gristo milikghteaydaanyi sean, aba heedeanyu, nea ghaahuuyi siida iidu jea eeteaschi ak aba heeda fuga jea ghamwas ak ghwanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mureeda ea gheambiida daba sugoocheanda eaweega manda muudeanooda was dea maygamutmudan, ak ea miidaach, niny ASEETA bwaageawi, ea ghoah eaweega manda muudeanooda. Amin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea orjeedeanyu Dimoteo, geagoonyeey diigheanji ghoah giidiiwshooda aba badayda ng'asheega was ramooranga ghayi ashoohu aba badaydaang'u, ak aba badaydeaba suh ging'uchi muuchi ng'ucheedida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak guhuwi siida masaweega biissa aamiy fughara aba gideaba gwanda fuga ninung'waada miyinda fughareeda, hean ghwadatas masaweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeaba fiisu gwanda geaba Himenayo ea Iskanda, ak fiisu ea neasachsi Shataani aba gideaba eanaal ak ea moong'eawa ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
